sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a

    opt State is NOT Authorized
        Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State Authorized
    end

    alt EVConnected is NOT true (Part 1)
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Occupied)
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Occupied, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = CablePluggedIn, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, evse.id = <Configured evseId>, evse.connectorId = <Configured connectorId>, eventType = Updated)
        CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    else EVConnected is true
        Note over CS,CSMS: Skip Part 1, proceed directly to Part 2
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Part 2
    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is EnergyTransferStarted<br>EVConnected is true
